  "description": "Newly renovated 2-Bedroom Apartment to Let – Sundrive Road, Dublin 12 \n\nOwn Door Entrance \n\nAddress: 52A Sundrive Road, Kimmage, Dublin 12, D12 E8VF Available:Immediately \n\nRent: €2,280.00 per month\n\n\nWelcome to this spacious, bright, and newly renovated 1st-floor, 2-bedroom apartment located on Sundrive Road, Kimmage,Dublin 12.\n\nThis property has been completely refurbished to an immaculate, modern standard. It is perfectly positioned close to CHI Crumlin, St. James’s Hospital, or The Coombe Women & Infants University Hospital.\n\n\nFlexible Sleeping Arrangements: The apartment comfortably would allow 2 to 3 sharing, with the option to configure the layout with three single beds, or a mix of double and single beds to suit your needs.\n\n\nAccommodation Briefly Comprises:\n\nEntrance: Large, welcoming entrance hallway.\n\nLiving Area: Bright and modern open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area. Features a fully fitted kitchen equipped with brand-new appliances and excellent natural light.\n\nBedrooms: One generously sized master double bedroom and a second spacious bedroom. Both are freshly painted and offer ample storage space.\n\nBathroom: Contemporary,  tiled bathroom equipped with an efficient, modern walk-in electric shower.\n\nHeating & Windows: Newly installed energy-efficient electric heaters and double-glazed windows throughout for maximum comfort and warmth.\n\nPrime Location & Commuting\n\nHospital Access: Minutes from Children's Health Ireland (CHI) Crumlin, with straightforward, rapid access to St. James’s Hospital and The Coombe.\n\nPublic Transport: Highly connected area. A major bus stop is located right outside your front door, offering high-frequency direct links straight into Dublin City Centre (approx. 15-minute commute) and surrounding medical hubs.\n\nLocal Amenities: Situated in a mature, vibrant neighborhood. Everything you need is within walking distance, including local cafes, SuperValu, Tesco, parks, gyms, and traditional village pubs.\n\nKey Features:\n\nCompletely renovated, refurbished, and freshly painted throughout.\nTurn-key condition, ready for immediate occupation\nBright, modern layout with premium finishes.\n\nEnhanced Security: Fitted with an intruder alarm, fire alarm, CCTV, and a secure video intercom system.\n\nExcellent local facilities, shops, and green spaces nearby.\n\nStrictly No Smokers / No Pets\nViewing Arrangements\n\nViewing is highly advised. Please note that a security deposit, proof of ID, and landlord/employment references will be required upon application.\n\nTo Arrange a Viewing: Please reply via email with a brief bio to introduce yourself and anyone who will be sharing the apartment with you.",
